## [ENT-001] | 2026-08-12 17:33 UTC | Link | error | ref: logbook/protocol.md
Batch-created bootstrap files reused one timestamp as their frontmatter id.
validate-ids.sh flagged DUPLICATE ID: logbook/protocol.md vs ANCHOR.md
(id: 20260812T171239Z); ascii-guard CI failed on both bootstrap pushes.
Fix: unique id per file, generated with date -u. The gate already existed
